  "name": "Cyber Runner",
  "type": "npc",
  "img": "icons/svg/mystery-man.svg",
  "system": {
    "biography": "<p>A veteran of the streets. He packs serious cyberware but owes his success to his smarts, and tells anyone who asks that flexibility and intelligence beat raw firepower. Often mentors up-and-coming street sams.</p>\n<p><strong>Augmented (applied):</strong> reaction 4 (13).</p>\n<p><strong>Initiative (printed):</strong> 4 (13) + 1D6 (3D6)</p>\n<p><strong>Bioware:</strong> Damage Compensator (3); Enhanced Articulation; Synthacardium (2); Tailored Pheromones (2)</p>\n<p><strong>Cyberware:</strong> Balance Augmentor; Bone Lacing (Plastic); Cybereyes (Low-Light, Rangefinder, Thermographic); Hand Blade (Retractable); Reaction Enhancer (+4); Smartlink II; Wired Reflexes (2) (alpha)</p>\n<p><strong>Gear:</strong> Ares Crusader MP (w/200 rounds explosive ammo, Level II Smartlink, Improved Gas Vent II); Armor Jacket; Franchi SPAS-22 (w/80 rounds explosive ammo, Level II Smartlink, Improved Gas Vent III); Survival Knife; Walther Palm Pistol (w/6 rounds APDS ammo); Additional gear as appropriate</p>\n<p><strong>Threat/Professional Rating:</strong> 5/4</p>\n<p><em>Cybertechnology (FASA 7119), Chrome Kings p.87.</em></p>",
